{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is satisfied by all numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of the form\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efdf88353594b171474ea2524c3f0ae41db382b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{a_1}{3}+\\frac{a_2}{3^2}+\\cdots+\\frac{a_{25}}{3^{25}}\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />,...,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45a80eb81b650a4ec2b7611338c8fbe460f794ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5b883d1d2788317d8f137e6f438976adfcbab8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 0\\le x&lt;1/3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 1/3\\le x&lt;2/3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 2/3\\le x&lt;1 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"468\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/9609845917316f5cd186c316b6a8f073e076228c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D) \\  } 0\\le x&lt;1/3 \\text{ or }2/3\\le x&lt;1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }1/2\\le x\\le 3/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"428\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can separate this into two cases.\n</p><p><b>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84b16161509fc81d43ce3983057c5f36feba3fa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /></b> Here, clearly the minimum sum is when all of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/486287eb34a9167f7e8f07a3d67177451506d65f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. The maximum sum is when the rest of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> are all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/7/717a88e6c703723dd6de17d218e0241513cc1be9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n=2}^{25}\\frac{2}{3^n}&lt;2\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{3^n}=2\\left(\\frac{\\frac{1}{9}}{1-\\frac{1}{3}}\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}.\\]\" width=\"287\" height=\"50\" /> Therefore, in this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/c/d5c080e63928ee223bc42db40ca149fee584bf1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le x&lt;1/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0bad78c0b52d180bb51ac7f3f167374b4d38a73b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /></b> Here, again, the minimum sum is when the rest of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> are all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, in which case the minimum sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. The maximum sum is attained when all of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. In that case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/5/7052b3ca4cfe70193c8932411fe8af0ea3c5cdd1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n=1}^{25}\\frac{2}{3^n}&lt;2\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{3^n}=2\\left(\\frac{\\frac{1}{3}}{1-\\frac{1}{3}}\\right)=1.\\]\" width=\"282\" height=\"50\" /> Therefore, in this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d61db2dca6da66501c6e62a91fd30f36fffe69dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/3\\le x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/c/d5c080e63928ee223bc42db40ca149fee584bf1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le x&lt;1/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d61db2dca6da66501c6e62a91fd30f36fffe69dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/3\\le x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w